          "module": "DUL.owl",
          "comment": "This is a placeholder for events that are considered in their evolution, or anyway not strictly dependent on agents, tasks, and plans. \nSee Event class for some thoughts on classifying events. See also 'Transition'.",
          "locator": "DUL.owl::<http://www.loa-cnr.it/ontologies/DUL.owl#Process> rdfs:comment"
        }
      ],
      "missing_in_selected_imports": false
    }
